"""Compact-star (white-dwarf) sparse inference reconstruction.

Self-contained (numpy/scipy/pandas only). Reads data/ and writes results/:
  - results/mr_reconstruction.csv
  - results/profiles_reconstruction.npz (density_fraction, enclosed_mass_fraction) 3x101
  - results/summary.json                (5 required keys)
  - results/reconstruction_plot.png     (self-contained numpy+stdlib PNG renderer)

Approved plan: data-first hybrid. M-R = weighted Chandrasekhar-family fit
R=C*M^-a*(1-(M/Mch)^b)^c + tapered smooth monotone residual correction; profiles =
monotone PCHIP per fragment + mass interpolation (1.3 crossed with calibrated
Lane-Emden polytrope). mass_limit_solar=Mch from the physics family.
"""
